definitions
  f(x: u8, y: i16 in -5..5) = expr [where y = expr, cond]
  g = x^2 + 1               free variables become parameters
  basis name [: parent] { gate(x, y) = expr [cost n]; ... }
  model name [: parent] { class: cost, ..., fuse f(a: int, ...) = expr : cost }
types: real (math), f16 f32 f64 (IEEE), int (math), uN iN (wrapping), bool
commands (F is a function name or an expression like isqrt(x: u4))
  show F | parse EXPR | table F [max n] | funcs | models | help
  range F [nocrit] | domain F | wrap F | crit F | diff F [x]
  equiv F G | error G ~ F | fit G ~ F [metric maxrel|maxabs|rms]
  gates F [basis b] [max k] [nodes n] [as c]
  find F [n] [max cost] | more [n]
  cost F [model m] | use m
  approx F [in a..b] [degree n|a..b] [error e] [ulp u] [as f32|f64|real]
    [relative|absolute] [odd|even|nosym] [keep endpoints|x1, x2..]
    [weight W] [at c] [fma|nofma] [norefine] [list n] [name p] [c]
  approx more [n]
  animate [hillis|blelloch|sequential] scan [n N] [fps F] [seconds S]
    [random [seed K] | values a, b, ...] [f32] [MODEL] [to NAME]
