    [polar] [field] [fps F] [frames N] [to NAME]; plot3d F; neighbourhood F
    [at a]
loops and calculus
  sum(i, lo, hi, e) | prod(...) | x[0] = c; x[k+1] = ... | { for/while/if }
  closed F | scheme F [more] [model m] | continuous F
  integrate F [wrt x] [from a to b] | antiderivative F [wrt x]
  diff F [x y ...] [n] | grad|hessian|laplacian F [at a, b] | F'' | F'(a)
