  limit F x -> a[+|-] [from left|right] | lim x->a F | wronskian F, G, ...
  taylor F [x] [at a] [order n] | implicit L = R [for y] [wrt x] [order 2]
  y' = f(t, y); y(0) = c | pde name { ... } | dsolve y [from a to b] [steps n]
complex numbers (i is the unit) and trig forms
  complex F | re F | im F | conj F | modulus F | arg F | polar F
